    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d577">

                <pb facs="0783" n="669" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg669"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/26071</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the Division of Mexican Affairs,
                        Department of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: By your direction, I
                    delivered the following message to Mr. Tellez<anchor n="26" xml:id="d577-f1"/>
                    on June 22: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“It has been intimated to the Department that Mr. de la Huerta<anchor
                                n="27" xml:id="d577-f2"/> is considering coming to Washington to
                            call on the President and the Secretary of State, if his visit would not
                            be unwelcome. You <pb facs="0784" n="670" xml:id="pg670"/> may assure
                            Mr. de la Huerta that, should he come to Washington, the President and
                            the Secretary of State, naturally in a personal and unofficial capacity,
                            would be pleased to have a talk with him.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed>M[<hi rendition="#small-caps">atthew</hi>] E. H[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">anna</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
